  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Two fair dices are rolled,</p><p>So total sample space will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p>Now given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;are in G.P.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp; or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;(rejected)</p><p>Now favourable cases for sum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>48</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>"
  }
